1
00:00:00,448 --> 00:00:01,936
Hey Flower, come check this out!

2
00:00:01,936 --> 00:00:03,504
Whatever it is, I don't care!

3
00:00:03,504 --> 00:00:05,792
But Flower, this time it's really important!

4
00:00:05,792 --> 00:00:07,792
Unless it is Dream Island, I don't wanna hear it.

5
00:00:07,792 --> 00:00:09,392
Oh, well... it's a bug.

6
00:00:09,392 --> 00:00:11,216
GAH! HEUGH-EGH!

7
00:00:12,224 --> 00:00:13,792
- AAAHAAA!
- AGH! AAAH!

8
00:00:13,792 --> 00:00:15,536
Oh, my gosh, Firey, I'll save you!

9
00:00:15,968 --> 00:00:17,024
FIREY:
AAA-

10
00:00:17,024 --> 00:00:18,896
FIREY:
-AAAUGH...UUAAAGH!!

11
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,384
HUUH?

12
00:00:32,288 --> 00:00:33,312
BUHHH!

13
00:00:33,344 --> 00:00:40,064
♪ [INTRO PLAYS] ♪

14
00:00:40,064 --> 00:00:42,060
Subtitles: Daniel Adam Valle

15
00:00:42,672 --> 00:00:44,896
So what do we do without the speaky box?

16
00:00:44,896 --> 00:00:45,840
I don't know.

17
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:47,360
I think it means we all win Dream Island!

18
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:49,360
No! I think it means I win Dream Island!

19
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:52,544
I think it means we should use
the replacement box that I built last night.

20
00:00:52,544 --> 00:00:54,256
Yeah, Firey's definitely right!

21
00:00:54,256 --> 00:00:54,816
Bleh!

22
00:00:54,816 --> 00:00:55,600
Rocky!

23
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:57,632
My replacement box is so much better!

24
00:00:57,632 --> 00:00:58,336
PBBBT!

25
00:00:58,640 --> 00:00:59,440
Hurtful!

26
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:00,912
That means we're using mine!

27
00:01:00,912 --> 00:01:01,504
Yeah!

28
00:01:01,504 --> 00:01:04,304
- But-but... but! B-b-but-but!
- Wh-wh-hhh-hu-what? But...!

29
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:05,424
How about we use both?

30
00:01:05,424 --> 00:01:06,640
WE CAN'T USE BOTH!

31
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:07,264
Why not?

32
00:01:07,264 --> 00:01:07,968
Fine.

33
00:01:07,968 --> 00:01:09,296
Then let's do Cake at Stake!

34
00:01:10,128 --> 00:01:11,504
♪ The points are gone ♪

35
00:01:11,504 --> 00:01:14,656
♪ We are free of them now, but we look on ♪

36
00:01:14,656 --> 00:01:15,712
♪ ♪

37
00:01:15,712 --> 00:01:18,192
♪ To the moment that we see: ♪

38
00:01:18,192 --> 00:01:20,336
♪ The next slice of cake ♪

39
00:01:20,336 --> 00:01:22,496
♪ A step closer to the prize ♪

40
00:01:22,496 --> 00:01:24,490
♪ Brought on by Cake at Stake! ♪

41
00:01:24,490 --> 00:01:25,808
♪ ♪

42
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:30,912
We got 844 votes, which is fewer than last time!

43
00:01:30,912 --> 00:01:32,272
Oh, that's too bad.

44
00:01:32,368 --> 00:01:35,072
The person who got the
most votes will be eliminated.

45
00:01:35,072 --> 00:01:36,096
I hope that's you!

46
00:01:36,096 --> 00:01:38,090
What? I can't be eliminated; I'm the host.

47
00:01:38,090 --> 00:01:39,248
No, I'm the host!

48
00:01:39,344 --> 00:01:40,256
HAAEEUGH!

49
00:01:40,256 --> 00:01:40,848
Oh, no!

50
00:01:40,848 --> 00:01:42,272
The cake is some Yoylecake!

51
00:01:42,272 --> 00:01:43,808
Oh, they're so cute!

52
00:01:43,808 --> 00:01:44,416
Grr!

53
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:45,312
Whoa!

54
00:01:45,312 --> 00:01:46,608
I'll give you cake if you're safe.

55
00:01:46,608 --> 00:01:48,496
- Spongy, you had immunity,
- Huh?

56
00:01:48,496 --> 00:01:49,488
so you're safe.

57
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:53,648
Firey, since you are so amazing and
awesome, you only got sixty-four votes.

58
00:01:54,848 --> 00:01:57,456
Whoa! What's with the tub? And where's the TV?

59
00:01:57,456 --> 00:01:59,450
We had to sell the TV because of budget cuts.

60
00:01:59,450 --> 00:02:02,256
Hmm. It doesn't sound the same when you say that.

61
00:02:02,432 --> 00:02:04,250
Uh, hello? Where's my cake?

62
00:02:04,250 --> 00:02:05,392
Here's your cake!

63
00:02:06,064 --> 00:02:08,448
Hey! Why'd you cut me such a small slice?

64
00:02:08,448 --> 00:02:10,992
Because I hate you! Oh, and I poisoned your cake, too.

65
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:12,400
Oh, wha?

66
00:02:12,624 --> 00:02:16,480
Leafy, since you are also awesome,
you only got sixty-nine votes.

67
00:02:18,032 --> 00:02:20,160
Yoylecake! And thanks for calling me awesome.

68
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:20,896
You're welcome.

69
00:02:20,896 --> 00:02:23,248
Oh, no! I think I'm gonna be eliminated!

70
00:02:23,248 --> 00:02:26,144
Well, I sure WISH that were the case, but it's NOT!

71
00:02:26,144 --> 00:02:27,872
Metal Ball, with eighty votes...

72
00:02:28,608 --> 00:02:29,520
...you're safe.

73
00:02:29,744 --> 00:02:30,720
YOYLECAKE!

74
00:02:30,832 --> 00:02:34,992
And it's down to Flower and Rocky.
Personally, I'd be fine with either leaving.

75
00:02:34,992 --> 00:02:35,568
Grr!

76
00:02:36,208 --> 00:02:37,920
Well anyway, let's show the votes.

77
00:02:39,792 --> 00:02:42,064
Wow! It's so close, I can't tell.

78
00:02:42,064 --> 00:02:45,744
And in the closest voting EVER,
Flower manages to stay in the game!

79
00:02:45,744 --> 00:02:46,560
No, she doesn't.

80
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:47,664
Yeah, she does!

81
00:02:47,664 --> 00:02:48,448
And how did you know?

82
00:02:48,448 --> 00:02:49,392
I just do!

83
00:02:49,392 --> 00:02:51,232
Well, why don't we measure it to find out?

84
00:02:51,232 --> 00:02:52,336
FINE, LET'S!

85
00:02:52,336 --> 00:02:56,736
♪ [SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC] ♪

86
00:02:56,736 --> 00:02:58,992
And Rocky is eliminated!

87
00:02:59,392 --> 00:03:00,912
Yes! High five, Leafy!

88
00:03:00,912 --> 00:03:01,872
Uhh, no, thanks.

89
00:03:04,304 --> 00:03:06,160
Finally! No more vomit.

90
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:08,000
Firey, that wasn't very nice!

91
00:03:08,112 --> 00:03:10,848
Hey Leafy, we made it to the final five!

92
00:03:10,848 --> 00:03:12,080
We are amazing!

93
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:13,792
We deserve a reward!

94
00:03:13,792 --> 00:03:15,920
Hey, Speakers, can I have a reward?

95
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:17,120
- You sure can!
- You sure can't!

96
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:18,736
Ooh, wow! What is it?

97
00:03:18,736 --> 00:03:19,536
It's a house.

98
00:03:19,536 --> 00:03:21,696
Wow! Does it mean we all get houses?

99
00:03:21,696 --> 00:03:22,688
- Yes.
- Yay!

100
00:03:22,688 --> 00:03:24,912
Mine's too small. I want a bigger one!

101
00:03:24,912 --> 00:03:27,072
Well, mine's just the right size!

102
00:03:27,072 --> 00:03:27,824
Hehehe!

103
00:03:27,824 --> 00:03:29,328
WHUH-OH! Whoa!

104
00:03:29,328 --> 00:03:31,808
WAH! WAAAH!

105
00:03:31,984 --> 00:03:33,888
Don't worry, Spongy! We've got backups.

106
00:03:33,888 --> 00:03:34,880
Really?

107
00:03:34,880 --> 00:03:36,496
Stop being so generous!

108
00:03:36,496 --> 00:03:38,976
And besides, we have to get to the CONTEST!

109
00:03:39,136 --> 00:03:40,464
The twenty-second contest is

110
00:03:40,464 --> 00:03:43,488
- a beauty contest! What?! No, it's not!
- To escape a volcano! What?! No, it's not!

111
00:03:43,488 --> 00:03:45,168
Fine. Let's have a vote.

112
00:03:45,168 --> 00:03:46,736
Who wants to escape the volcano?

113
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:49,056
And who wants a beauty contest?

114
00:03:49,264 --> 00:03:50,720
Mine overrules all of yours!

115
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:52,368
That means we're going to escape the volcano.

116
00:03:52,368 --> 00:03:53,600
YEAH!

117
00:03:54,608 --> 00:03:57,920
- FLOWER SPEAKER BOX: Ready to go?
- Uh, not quite! I can't find the parachutes!

118
00:03:57,920 --> 00:03:59,952
FLOWER SPEAKER BOX:
Ha-ha! There are no parachutes!

119
00:03:59,952 --> 00:04:02,272
AAAAAH!

120
00:04:04,976 --> 00:04:08,256
The first person to get out of
the volcano wins immunity.

121
00:04:08,256 --> 00:04:09,187
- If you fall into lava-

122
00:04:09,187 --> 00:04:09,771
- Magma.
- If you fall into lava-

123
00:04:09,771 --> 00:04:11,472
MAGMA, and DIE,

124
00:04:11,472 --> 00:04:13,248
you have to start all over again!

125
00:04:13,248 --> 00:04:15,120
Oh, my gosh, that's so unfair!

126
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:15,888
GO!

127
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,648
Huh! Ha-ha!

128
00:04:17,648 --> 00:04:18,400
Hup!

129
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:20,400
AAAAAAAAH!

130
00:04:21,792 --> 00:04:22,400
Hup!

131
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:23,344
HEEUUGH!

132
00:04:23,888 --> 00:04:25,648
Hey! I'm a bubble again.

133
00:04:25,648 --> 00:04:26,400
Yeah!

134
00:04:27,248 --> 00:04:29,024
Heuuugh-HOHOOOH!

135
00:04:31,136 --> 00:04:32,400
Ooh, ooh, ow! Hot!

136
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:35,152
Oh, I know you can do it,
Flower! Just give it a try!

137
00:04:37,552 --> 00:04:38,384
Heugh-ugh!

138
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:44,416
AAAAAH!!!

139
00:04:44,496 --> 00:04:46,912
Hey! Why don't we run across
Spongy as he's falling in?

140
00:04:46,912 --> 00:04:47,504
Okay!

141
00:04:47,504 --> 00:04:48,528
BUUUUH!

142
00:04:48,912 --> 00:04:49,664
Yeaaah!

143
00:04:49,792 --> 00:04:51,360
Hup! Hup! Hup! Hup! Hup! Hup!

144
00:04:56,928 --> 00:04:58,128
Whoa-wee!

145
00:04:59,584 --> 00:05:00,688
AAAHH!

146
00:05:02,576 --> 00:05:03,184
BUUUH!

147
00:05:03,184 --> 00:05:04,192
Heh! Heh! Hup! Buah!

148
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:10,112
Ha-ha! I'm gonna beat you! I'm gonna beat all of you!

149
00:05:10,112 --> 00:05:12,080
And I'm-I'm gonna go on and win Dream Island!

150
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:15,728
And-and, you're not! Y-you're gonna
get the opposite of Dream Island!

151
00:05:15,728 --> 00:05:18,768
Uh, dr-dream, n-nightmare... Nightmare Moon!

152
00:05:19,104 --> 00:05:20,016
AAAAAH!

153
00:05:26,576 --> 00:05:27,648
Woah! What's going on?

154
00:05:27,648 --> 00:05:29,104
The volcano's erupting!

155
00:05:29,104 --> 00:05:29,952
Oh, no!

156
00:05:33,632 --> 00:05:34,896
Wheeh-whoa!

157
00:05:35,456 --> 00:05:36,080
AHHHH!

158
00:05:36,976 --> 00:05:38,208
AAAAAAAAAAH!

159
00:05:53,728 --> 00:05:57,232
You all escaped the volcano at the
same time, so we need a tie-breaker.

160
00:05:57,232 --> 00:05:57,854
- And what is the tie-breaker-

161
00:05:57,854 --> 00:05:59,230
- A BEAUTY CONTEST!
- And what is the tie-breaker-

162
00:05:59,230 --> 00:06:00,576
- We're both judges!
- Okay!

163
00:06:00,848 --> 00:06:02,976
I think Flower's the most beautiful!

164
00:06:02,976 --> 00:06:05,216
Well, I think Firey has the most beauty.

165
00:06:05,216 --> 00:06:07,040
I guess they both get immunity then!

166
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:07,744
- YAY!
- YEAH!

167
00:06:07,744 --> 00:06:11,152
FIREY SPEAKER BOX:
Bubble, Leafy, and Spongy are up for elimination.

168
00:06:11,152 --> 00:06:15,728
Vote one of them right now! Whoever gets
the most votes WILL BE ELIMINATED!